step	1	1	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Odd Old Man</col> in <col=800000>Silvarea</col> wants to complete his collection, and gave me a much longer wish list of bones to bring him, polished in vinegar just as before. I should check the list on the wall of his hut to see which bones he still needs, and hand them in as I polish them.</col>
done	<str>The Odd Old Man in Silvarea wants to complete his collection, and gave me a much longer wish list of bones to bring him, polished in vinegar just as before.</str>
done	<str>I brought every bone on the Odd Old Man's wish list, and his collection is finally complete.</str>
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
